                    </bibl>
                     <note corresp="#bibl">The text contained in the manuscript corresponds to the same miracle as is found in the collection of the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3977Taammer">'Miracoli in vita' of Gabra Manfas Qeddus'</ref>; however, the redaction in this manuscript better corresponds to the text of the "redazione più ridotta, proveniente da unico archetipo", that is indicated in the apparatus of the printed edition with the siglum "A" ("Tutti i mss. di questa redazione sono indicati in apparato, se in accordo tra loro, con la sigla “A”.").<bibl> 
                           <ptr target="bm:Raineri2004CerulliEtiopici"/>
                           <citedRange unit="page">XV</citedRange>
                        </bibl>
                     </note>
                     <explicit xml:lang="gez" type="supplication"> 
